'''Description:''' Clerics who take the Good domain command power over outsiders and are granted spells that protect themselves and others.[[Image:Id good.gif|right|Good]]
== Domain Special Abilities ==

Turn Outsiders - Able to [[turn undead|turn]] [[outsider]]s as if they were [[undead]].

== Bonus Spells ==
* Level 4 [[Stoneskin]]
* Level 5 [[Lesser planar binding]]

==Notes==
*The changes from [[Hordes of the Underdark]] give outsiders [[turn resistance]] equal to their [[spell resistance]]. [[Planar turning]] reduces this resistance by 1/2.

